"entity": {
"name": "Neurones SA",
"description": "Neurones SA engages in the provision of consulting and digital services. The company operates through the following segments: Infrastructure Services, Application Services, and Consulting. The Infrastructure Services segment includes service desk, workstation outsourcing, server and application outsourcing in cloud, computing mode, IT security, IT operations, IT service management, and IT governance. The Application Services segment comprises of IT consulting for finance, SAP integration and outsourcing, IT training and working with change, and mobile applications. The Consulting segment provides management, digital marketing, and organization consulting. The company was founded by Luc de Chammard on December 5, 1984 and is headquartered in Nanterre, France.",
